     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Capacidad del dep\303\263sito de NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS continuo con el dep\303\263sito lleno (valor de Spire: 20 s). Se ignora con Requerir kit de NOS activado: entonces la fase del kit de NOS fija el dep\303\263sito.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tiempo de entrada del NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tiempo hasta alcanzar la fuerza m\303\241xima del NOS (valor de Spire: 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Recarga del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS que se recuperan por segundo sin usarlo. Se ignora con Requerir kit de NOS activado: entonces la fase del kit de NOS fija la recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del sonido del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen de los sonidos del NOS. Los controles de volumen del propio juego no los cambian.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del NOS de los Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del NOS de los Drivatars, que se oye desde sus coches (con NOS de los Drivatars activado). 0 lo silencia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibraci\303\263n de c\303\241mara con NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Cu\303\241nto tiembla la c\303\241mara con el NOS activo, en las vistas de piloto, cap\303\263, parachoques y persecuci\303\263n. 0 lo desactiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Campo de visi\303\263n amplio con NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Cu\303\241nto se ampl\303\255a el campo de visi\303\263n con el NOS activo, en las vistas de piloto, cap\303\263, parachoques y persecuci\303\263n. 0 lo desactiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Inyecci\303\263n de NOS. Mant\303\251n pulsado el bot\303\263n de NOS mientras conduces; cuanto mayor la fase, mayor el dep\303\263sito y m\303\241s r\303\241pida la recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"De serie\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sin sistema de NOS instalado.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, fase {n}: dep\303\263sito de {s} s, recarga {r} s por segundo.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10391},
    /* es_MX.po: 55 strings */
    {"es-MX",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS de Fast & Furious para todos los autos de Forza Horizon 2, con llamas en el escape, sonido e indicador de NOS. Mant\303\251n el bot\303\263n de NOS (LB si no lo cambias) para acelerar.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sistema de nitro ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Activa o desactiva el NOS de Fast & Furious. Mant\303\251n presionado el bot\303\263n de NOS mientras manejas para acelerar.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Superposici\303\263n de depuraci\303\263n del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Muestra sobre el juego informaci\303\263n de depuraci\303\263n del NOS y las llamas (requiere modo ventana o sin bordes).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Petardeo en todos los autos\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Permite que todos los autos petardeen, algo que necesitan las llamas del NOS. Desactivado, se mantiene la configuraci\303\263n del propio juego. Se aplica al reiniciar el juego.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Rellenar NOS al iniciar la carrera\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Llena el tanque de NOS al iniciar una carrera, al abandonarla, al cambiar de auto o al hacer un viaje r\303\241pido.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Devolver NOS al rebobinar\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Al rebobinar recuperas el NOS gastado desde el punto al que vuelves.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibraci\303\263n del control con NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Hace vibrar el control mientras el NOS est\303\241 activo. La vibraci\303\263n del propio juego no cambia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS de los Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Los Drivatars tambi\303\251n usan NOS siempre que pueden (nunca antes de la salida), con un tanque del doble de capacidad y recarga que el tuyo, con llamas y sonido. No cuando te llevan m\303\241s de 100 m de ventaja, para que puedas alcanzarlos. Se aplica de inmediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Requerir kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Activado: solo los autos con el kit de NOS (se compra en el garaje, como mejora del motor) tienen NOS, y la etapa fija el tanque y su recarga. Desactivado: todos los autos tienen NOS, con la capacidad del tanque de NOS y la recarga del NOS, y el kit de NOS no est\303\241 en el garaje.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ocultar indicador sin kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Activado: el marco del indicador de NOS se oculta en los autos sin kit de NOS. Desactivado: queda un marco vac\303\255o.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vi\303\261eta azul del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Una vi\303\261eta azul pulsante en los bordes de la pantalla mientras el NOS est\303\241 activo.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"L\303\255neas de velocidad del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Finas estelas azules que vuelan hacia los bordes de la pantalla mientras el NOS est\303\241 activo, al ritmo de la velocidad del auto.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Bot\303\263n de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"El bot\303\263n que activa el NOS. Elige uno que el juego no use al manejar. Se aplica de inmediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Elige uno que el juego no use al manejar. Se aplica de inmediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tema del HUD\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original: el HUD del juego con una barra de NOS amarilla. Fast & Furious: barra de NOS, marchas e iconos de asistencias en cian.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Original (barra de NOS amarilla), 2 Fast & Furious (barra de NOS, marchas e iconos de asistencias en cian).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplicador del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplica la aceleraci\303\263n hacia adelante mientras el NOS est\303\241 activo (valor de Spire: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Capacidad del tanque de NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS continuo con el tanque lleno (valor de Spire: 20 s). Se ignora con Requerir kit de NOS activado: entonces la etapa del kit de NOS fija el tanque.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tiempo de entrada del NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tiempo hasta alcanzar la fuerza m\303\241xima del NOS (valor de Spire: 0.5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Recarga del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS que se recuperan por segundo sin usarlo. Se ignora con Requerir kit de NOS activado: entonces la etapa del kit de NOS fija la recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del sonido del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen de los sonidos del NOS. Los controles de volumen del propio juego no los cambian.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del NOS de los Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volumen del NOS de los Drivatars, que se oye desde sus autos (con NOS de los Drivatars activado). 0 lo silencia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibraci\303\263n de c\303\241mara con NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Cu\303\241nto tiembla la c\303\241mara con el NOS activo, en las vistas de conductor, cap\303\263, parachoques y persecuci\303\263n. 0 lo desactiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Campo de visi\303\263n amplio con NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Cu\303\241nto se ampl\303\255a el campo de visi\303\263n con el NOS activo, en las vistas de conductor, cap\303\263, parachoques y persecuci\303\263n. 0 lo desactiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Inyecci\303\263n de NOS. Mant\303\251n presionado el bot\303\263n de NOS mientras manejas; cuanto mayor la etapa, mayor el tanque y m\303\241s r\303\241pida la recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"De f\303\241brica\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS etapa 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS etapa 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS etapa 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS etapa 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sin sistema de NOS instalado.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, etapa {n}: tanque de {s} s, recarga {r} s por segundo.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10403},
    /* fr.po: 55 strings */
    {"fr",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Le NOS Fast & Furious pour toutes les voitures de Forza Horizon 2, avec flammes \303\240 l'\303\251chappement, son et jauge de NOS. Maintenez le bouton de NOS (LB par d\303\251faut) pour acc\303\251l\303\251rer.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Syst\303\250me de nitro ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Active ou d\303\251sactive le NOS Fast & Furious. Maintenez le bouton de NOS en conduisant pour acc\303\251l\303\251rer.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Superposition de d\303\251bogage NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Affiche par-dessus le jeu les infos de d\303\251bogage du NOS et des flammes (mode fen\303\252tr\303\251 ou sans bordure requis).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Retours de flamme sur toutes les voitures\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Permet \303\240 chaque voiture d'avoir des retours de flamme, n\303\251cessaires aux flammes du NOS. D\303\251sactiv\303\251, les r\303\251glages du jeu restent inchang\303\251s. Prend effet apr\303\250s un red\303\251marrage.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Remplir le NOS au d\303\251part\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Remplit le r\303\251servoir de NOS au d\303\251part d'une course, quand vous en quittez une, changez de voiture ou faites un voyage instantan\303\251.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Rendre le NOS au rembobinage\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Le rembobinage rend le NOS utilis\303\251 depuis le moment o\303\271 vous revenez.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibration de la manette (NOS)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Fait vibrer la manette pendant le NOS. Les vibrations du jeu ne changent pas.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS des Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Les Drivatars utilisent aussi le NOS d\303\250s qu'ils le peuvent (jamais avant le d\303\251part), avec un r\303\251servoir deux fois plus grand et une recharge deux fois plus rapide que les v\303\264tres, flammes et son compris. Pas quand ils ont plus de 100 m d'avance sur vous, pour que vous puissiez les rattraper. Effet imm\303\251diat.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit de NOS requis\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Activ\303\251 : seules les voitures \303\251quip\303\251es du kit de NOS (achet\303\251 au garage, comme am\303\251lioration du moteur) ont du NOS, et le niveau fixe le r\303\251servoir et sa recharge. D\303\251sactiv\303\251 : toutes les voitures ont du NOS, avec la capacit\303\251 du r\303\251servoir de NOS et la recharge du NOS, et le kit de NOS n'est pas au garage.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Masquer la jauge sans kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Activ\303\251 : le cadre de la jauge de NOS est masqu\303\251 sur les voitures sans kit de NOS. D\303\251sactiv\303\251 : un cadre vide reste affich\303\251.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vignettage bleu (NOS)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Un vignettage bleu puls\303\251 sur les bords de l'\303\251cran pendant le NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Lignes de vitesse (NOS)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"De fines tra\303\256n\303\251es bleues filent vers les bords de l'\303\251cran pendant le NOS, au rythme de la vitesse de la voiture.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Bouton de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Le bouton qui d\303\251clenche le NOS. Choisissez-en un que le jeu n'utilise pas en conduite. Effet imm\303\251diat.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Choisissez-en un que le jeu n'utilise pas en conduite. Effet imm\303\251diat.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Th\303\250me de l'ATH\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original : l'ATH du jeu avec une barre de NOS jaune. Fast & Furious : barre de NOS, rapports et ic\303\264nes d'aides en cyan.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Original (barre de NOS jaune), 2 Fast & Furious (barre de NOS, rapports et ic\303\264nes d'aides en cyan).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplicateur de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplie l'acc\303\251l\303\251ration vers l'avant pendant le NOS (valeur de Spire : 1,6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Capacit\303\251 du r\303\251servoir de NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Secondes de boost continu dans un r\303\251servoir plein (valeur de Spire : 20 s). Ignor\303\251 quand Kit de NOS requis est activ\303\251 : c'est alors le niveau du kit de NOS qui fixe le r\303\251servoir.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Mont\303\251e en puissance du NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Temps n\303\251cessaire pour atteindre la pleine pouss\303\251e (valeur de Spire : 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Recharge du NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Secondes de NOS r\303\251cup\303\251r\303\251es par seconde hors boost. Ignor\303\251 quand Kit de NOS requis est activ\303\251 : c'est alors le niveau du kit de NOS qui fixe la recharge.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume du son du NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume des sons de boost et d'arr\303\252t. Les r\303\251glages de volume du jeu ne les modifient pas.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume du NOS des Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume du NOS des Drivatars, entendu depuis leurs voitures (avec NOS des Drivatars activ\303\251). 0 le coupe.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tremblement de cam\303\251ra (NOS)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Intensit\303\251 du tremblement de la cam\303\251ra pendant le NOS, en vues pilote, capot, pare-chocs et poursuite. 0 le d\303\251sactive.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Champ de vision \303\251largi (NOS)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"De combien le champ de vision s'\303\251largit pendant le NOS, en vues pilote, capot, pare-chocs et poursuite. 0 le d\303\251sactive.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Injection de NOS. Maintenez le bouton de NOS en conduisant ; plus le niveau est \303\251lev\303\251, plus le r\303\251servoir est grand et se recharge vite.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"D'origine\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS niveau 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS niveau 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS niveau 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS niveau 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Aucun syst\303\250me de NOS install\303\251.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, niveau {n} : r\303\251servoir de {s} s, recharge {r} s par seconde.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10475},
    /* it.po: 55 strings */
    {"it",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Il NOS di Fast & Furious per tutte le auto di Forza Horizon 2, con fiamme dallo scarico, suono e indicatore NOS. Tieni premuto il pulsante del NOS (LB se non lo cambi) per accelerare.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sistema nitro ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Attiva o disattiva il NOS di Fast & Furious. Tieni premuto il pulsante del NOS durante la guida per accelerare.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Overlay di debug del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Mostra sopra il gioco le informazioni di debug del NOS e delle fiamme (richiede la modalit\303\240 finestra o senza bordi).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ritorni di fiamma su tutte le auto\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Consente a ogni auto i ritorni di fiamma, necessari alle fiamme del NOS. Disattivato, lascia invariate le impostazioni del gioco. Ha effetto dopo il riavvio.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ricarica il NOS alla partenza\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Riempie il serbatoio del NOS quando parte una gara, quando ne esci, cambi auto o usi il trasferimento rapido.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Restituisci il NOS al riavvolgimento\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Riavvolgendo recuperi il NOS usato dal punto a cui torni.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibrazione del controller col NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Fa vibrare il controller mentre il NOS \303\250 attivo. La vibrazione del gioco non cambia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS dei Drivatar\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Anche i Drivatar usano il NOS quando possono (mai prima della partenza), con un serbatoio dalla capacit\303\240 e dalla ricarica doppie rispetto alle tue, con fiamme e suono. Non quando sono pi\303\271 di 100 m davanti a te, cos\303\254 puoi raggiungerli. Effetto immediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Richiedi kit NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Attivo: solo le auto con il kit NOS (si compra in garage, come potenziamento del motore) hanno il NOS, e lo stadio ne fissa serbatoio e ricarica. Disattivo: tutte le auto hanno il NOS, con la capacit\303\240 del serbatoio del NOS e la ricarica del NOS, e il kit NOS non \303\250 in garage.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Nascondi indicatore senza kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Attivo: la cornice dell'indicatore NOS \303\250 nascosta sulle auto senza kit NOS. Disattivo: resta una cornice vuota.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vignettatura blu del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Una vignettatura blu pulsante ai bordi dello schermo mentre il NOS \303\250 attivo.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Linee di velocit\303\240 del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sottili scie blu che volano verso i bordi dello schermo mentre il NOS \303\250 attivo, al ritmo della velocit\303\240 dell'auto.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Pulsante del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Il pulsante che attiva il NOS. Scegline uno che il gioco non usa durante la guida. Effetto immediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Scegline uno che il gioco non usa durante la guida. Effetto immediato.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tema dell'HUD\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Originale\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Originale: l'HUD del gioco con la barra NOS gialla. Fast & Furious: barra NOS, marce e icone degli aiuti in ciano.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Originale (barra NOS gialla), 2 Fast & Furious (barra NOS, marce e icone degli aiuti in ciano).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Moltiplicatore del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Moltiplica l'accelerazione in avanti mentre il NOS \303\250 attivo (valore di Spire: 1,6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Capacit\303\240 del serbatoio del NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Secondi di boost continuo con il serbatoio pieno (valore di Spire: 20 s). Ignorato con Richiedi kit NOS attivo: allora il serbatoio dipende dallo stadio del kit NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tempo di entrata del NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tempo per arrivare alla piena spinta del NOS (valore di Spire: 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ricarica del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Secondi di NOS recuperati al secondo quando non lo usi. Ignorato con Richiedi kit NOS attivo: allora la ricarica dipende dallo stadio del kit NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume del suono del NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume dei suoni del boost e dell'arresto. I cursori del volume del gioco non li cambiano.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume del NOS dei Drivatar\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume del NOS dei Drivatar, udito dalle loro auto (con NOS dei Drivatar attivo). 0 lo silenzia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tremolio della visuale col NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Quanto trema la visuale col NOS attivo, nelle visuali pilota, cofano, paraurti e inseguimento. 0 lo disattiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Campo visivo pi\303\271 ampio col NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Quanto si allarga il campo visivo col NOS attivo, nelle visuali pilota, cofano, paraurti e inseguimento. 0 lo disattiva.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Iniezione di NOS. Tieni premuto il pulsante del NOS durante la guida; pi\303\271 alto \303\250 lo stadio, pi\303\271 grande \303\250 il serbatoio e pi\303\271 rapida la ricarica.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
