    /* nl.po: 55 strings */
    {"nl",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Fast & Furious-NOS voor elke auto in Forza Horizon 2, met uitlaatvlammen, geluid en een NOS-meter. Houd de NOS-knop (standaard LB) ingedrukt om te boosten.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Nitrosysteem ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Zet de Fast & Furious-NOS aan of uit. Houd tijdens het rijden de NOS-knop ingedrukt om te boosten.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-debugoverlay\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Toont debuginfo over NOS en vlammen boven het spel (vereist venstermodus of randloos).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Knallende uitlaat bij alle auto's\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Laat elke auto knallen uit de uitlaat, wat de NOS-vlammen nodig hebben. Uit laat de instellingen van het spel zelf ongemoeid. Werkt na een herstart.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS bijvullen bij racestart\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vult de NOS-tank wanneer een race start, je er een verlaat, van auto wisselt of snel reist.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS terug bij terugspoelen\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Terugspoelen geeft de NOS terug die je sinds dat punt hebt gebruikt.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Controllervibratie bij NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Laat de controller trillen zolang NOS actief is. De vibratie van het spel zelf verandert niet.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Drivatar-NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ook Drivatars gebruiken NOS wanneer ze kunnen (niet voor de start), uit een tank met twee keer jouw capaciteit en bijvulsnelheid, met vlammen en geluid. Niet als ze meer dan 100 m voor je liggen, zodat je ze kunt inhalen. Werkt meteen.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-kit vereist\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Aan: alleen auto's met de NOS-kit (te koop in de garage als motor-upgrade) hebben NOS, en de fase bepaalt de tank en hoe snel die bijvult. Uit: elke auto heeft NOS, met de inhoud van de NOS-tank en de NOS-bijvulsnelheid, en de NOS-kit staat niet in de garage.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Meter verbergen zonder kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Aan: het kader van de NOS-meter is verborgen bij auto's zonder NOS-kit. Uit: er blijft een leeg kader staan.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Blauwe NOS-vignet\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Een pulserende blauwe vignet aan de randen van het scherm zolang NOS actief is.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-snelheidslijnen\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Dunne blauwe strepen die naar de randen van het scherm vliegen zolang NOS actief is, in het tempo van de snelheid van de auto.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-knop\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"De knop die NOS gebruikt. Kies er een die het spel tijdens het rijden niet gebruikt. Werkt meteen.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Kies er een die het spel tijdens het rijden niet gebruikt. Werkt meteen.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Thema scherminfo\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Origineel\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Origineel: de scherminfo van het spel met een gele NOS-balk. Fast & Furious: NOS-balk, versnellingen en hulpiconen in cyaan.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Origineel (gele NOS-balk), 2 Fast & Furious (NOS-balk, versnellingen en hulpiconen in cyaan).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-boostfactor\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vermenigvuldigt de acceleratie naar voren zolang NOS actief is (standaard in Spire: 1,6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Inhoud NOS-tank (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Seconden onafgebroken boost in een volle tank (standaard in Spire: 20 s). Genegeerd als NOS-kit vereist aan staat: dan bepaalt de fase van de NOS-kit de tank.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Opbouwtijd NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tijd tot de volle boostkracht (standaard in Spire: 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-bijvulsnelheid\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Seconden NOS die per seconde terugkomen zonder boost. Genegeerd als NOS-kit vereist aan staat: dan bepaalt de fase van de NOS-kit de NOS-bijvulsnelheid.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume NOS-geluid\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume van de boost- en stopgeluiden. De volumeschuiven van het spel zelf veranderen ze niet.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume Drivatar-NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume van de NOS van Drivatars, te horen vanuit hun auto's (met Drivatar-NOS aan). 0 zet het uit.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Camerabeweging bij NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Hoe sterk de camera beweegt bij NOS, in de coureur-, bonnet-, bumper- en achtervolgcamera. 0 zet het uit.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Breder beeld bij NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Hoeveel breder het beeld wordt bij NOS, in de coureur-, bonnet-, bumper- en achtervolgcamera. 0 zet het uit.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS-injectie. Houd tijdens het rijden de NOS-knop ingedrukt; hoe hoger de fase, hoe groter de tank en hoe sneller die bijvult.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Standaard\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS fase 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Geen NOS-systeem ingebouwd.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, fase {n}: tank van {s} s, vult {r} s per seconde bij.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10022},
    /* pl.po: 55 strings */
    {"pl",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS z Fast & Furious dla ka\305\274dego auta w Forza Horizon 2, z p\305\202omieniami z wydechu, d\305\272wi\304\231kiem i wska\305\272nikiem NOS. Przytrzymaj przycisk NOS (domy\305\233lnie LB), aby przyspieszy\304\207.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"System nitro ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"W\305\202\304\205cza lub wy\305\202\304\205cza NOS z Fast & Furious. Przytrzymaj przycisk NOS podczas jazdy, aby przyspieszy\304\207.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Nak\305\202adka debugowania NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Wy\305\233wietla na grze informacje debugowania NOS i p\305\202omieni (wymaga trybu okna lub okna bez ramki).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Strza\305\202y z wydechu we wszystkich autach\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Pozwala ka\305\274demu autu strzela\304\207 z wydechu, czego potrzebuj\304\205 p\305\202omienie NOS. Wy\305\202\304\205czone zostawia ustawienia samej gry. Dzia\305\202a po ponownym uruchomieniu.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Uzupe\305\202nij NOS na starcie wy\305\233cigu\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Nape\305\202nia zbiornik NOS, gdy wy\305\233cig si\304\231 zaczyna, gdy go opuszczasz, zmieniasz auto lub u\305\274ywasz szybkiej jazdy.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Zwrot NOS przy przewijaniu\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Przewijanie oddaje NOS zu\305\274yty od miejsca, do kt\303\263rego wracasz.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Wibracje kontrolera przy NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kontroler wibruje, gdy NOS jest aktywny. Wibracje samej gry pozostaj\304\205 bez zmian.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS Drivatar\303\263w\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Drivatary te\305\274 u\305\274ywaj\304\205 NOS, kiedy tylko mog\304\205 (nie przed startem wy\305\233cigu), ze zbiornika o dwa razy wi\304\231kszej pojemno\305\233ci i szybszym \305\202adowaniu ni\305\274 tw\303\263j, z p\305\202omieniami i d\305\272wi\304\231kiem. Nie wtedy, gdy s\304\205 ponad 100 m przed tob\304\205, wi\304\231c mo\305\274esz je dogoni\304\207. Dzia\305\202a od razu.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Wymagaj zestawu NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"W\305\202.: NOS maj\304\205 tylko auta z zestawem NOS (kupowanym w gara\305\274u jako ulepszenie silnika), a stopie\305\204 ustala zbiornik i jego \305\202adowanie. Wy\305\202.: ka\305\274de auto ma NOS, z pojemno\305\233ci\304\205 zbiornika NOS i szybko\305\233ci\304\205 \305\202adowania NOS, a zestawu NOS nie ma w gara\305\274u.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ukryj wska\305\272nik bez zestawu\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"W\305\202.: ramka wska\305\272nika NOS jest ukryta w autach bez zestawu NOS. Wy\305\202.: zostaje pusta ramka.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Niebieska winieta NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Pulsuj\304\205ca niebieska winieta na kraw\304\231dziach ekranu, gdy NOS jest aktywny.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Linie pr\304\231dko\305\233ci NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Cienkie niebieskie smugi lec\304\205ce ku kraw\304\231dziom ekranu, gdy NOS jest aktywny, w tempie pr\304\231dko\305\233ci auta.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Przycisk NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Przycisk, kt\303\263ry odpala NOS. Wybierz taki, kt\303\263rego gra nie u\305\274ywa podczas jazdy. Dzia\305\202a od razu.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Wybierz taki, kt\303\263rego gra nie u\305\274ywa podczas jazdy. Dzia\305\202a od razu.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Motyw ekranu\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Oryginalny\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Oryginalny: ekran gry z \305\274\303\263\305\202tym paskiem NOS. Fast & Furious: pasek NOS, biegi i ikony asyst w kolorze cyjan.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Oryginalny (\305\274\303\263\305\202ty pasek NOS), 2 Fast & Furious (pasek NOS, biegi i ikony asyst w kolorze cyjan).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Mno\305\274nik NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Mno\305\274y przyspieszenie do przodu, gdy NOS jest aktywny (domy\305\233lnie w Spire: 1,6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Pojemno\305\233\304\207 zbiornika NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Liczba sekund ci\304\205g\305\202ego przyspieszania przy pe\305\202nym zbiorniku (domy\305\233lnie w Spire: 20 s). Ignorowane, gdy Wymagaj zestawu NOS jest w\305\202.: wtedy zbiornik ustala stopie\305\204 zestawu NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Czas narastania NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Czas doj\305\233cia do pe\305\202nej si\305\202y NOS (domy\305\233lnie w Spire: 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Szybko\305\233\304\207 \305\202adowania NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ile sekund NOS wraca na sekund\304\231, gdy go nie u\305\274ywasz. Ignorowane, gdy Wymagaj zestawu NOS jest w\305\202.: wtedy szybko\305\233\304\207 \305\202adowania ustala stopie\305\204 zestawu NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"G\305\202o\305\233no\305\233\304\207 d\305\272wi\304\231ku NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"G\305\202o\305\233no\305\233\304\207 d\305\272wi\304\231k\303\263w NOS. Suwaki g\305\202o\305\233no\305\233ci samej gry ich nie zmieniaj\304\205.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"G\305\202o\305\233no\305\233\304\207 NOS Drivatar\303\263w\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"G\305\202o\305\233no\305\233\304\207 NOS Drivatar\303\263w, s\305\202yszanego z ich aut (gdy NOS Drivatar\303\263w jest w\305\202\304\205czony). 0 go wycisza.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Drgania kamery przy NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Jak mocno trz\304\231sie si\304\231 kamera, gdy NOS jest aktywny, w widokach kierowcy, maski, zderzaka i zza auta. 0 wy\305\202\304\205cza.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Szersze pole widzenia przy NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"O ile poszerza si\304\231 pole widzenia, gdy NOS jest aktywny, w widokach kierowcy, maski, zderzaka i zza auta. 0 wy\305\202\304\205cza.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Zestaw NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Wtrysk NOS. Przytrzymaj przycisk NOS podczas jazdy; im wy\305\274szy stopie\305\204, tym wi\304\231kszy zbiornik i szybsze \305\202adowanie.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Fabryczne\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS stopie\305\204 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS stopie\305\204 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS stopie\305\204 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS stopie\305\204 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Brak zamontowanego NOS.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, stopie\305\204 {n}: zbiornik {s} s, \305\202aduje {r} s na sekund\304\231.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10180},
    /* pt_BR.po: 55 strings */
    {"pt-BR",
     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS de Fast & Furious para todos os carros do Forza Horizon 2, com chamas no escape, som e medidor de NOS. Segure o Bot\303\243o do NOS (LB, a menos que voc\303\252 mude) para acelerar.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Nitro System ({button})\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sistema de Nitro ({button})\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Turns the Fast & Furious NOS on or off. Hold the NOS Button while driving to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Liga ou desliga o NOS de Fast & Furious. Segure o Bot\303\243o do NOS enquanto dirige para acelerar.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Debug Overlay\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sobreposi\303\247\303\243o de depura\303\247\303\243o do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DebugOverlay.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Draws NOS and flame debug info over the game (needs borderless/windowed mode).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Mostra informa\303\247\303\265es de depura\303\247\303\243o do NOS e das chamas sobre o jogo (requer modo janela ou sem bordas).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Backfire on All Cars\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Estouros no escape em todos os carros\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BackfireOnAllCars.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Lets every car backfire, which the NOS exhaust flames need. Off leaves the game's own backfire settings alone. Takes effect after a restart.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Permite que todos os carros estourem no escape, o que as chamas do NOS precisam. Desligado mant\303\251m as configura\303\247\303\265es do pr\303\263prio jogo. Vale ap\303\263s reiniciar o jogo.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refill NOS on Race Start\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Recarregar NOS no in\303\255cio da corrida\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefillOnRaceStart.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fills the NOS tank when a race starts, you quit one, you change car or you fast travel.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Enche o tanque de NOS quando uma corrida come\303\247a, quando voc\303\252 sai de uma, troca de carro ou faz viagem r\303\241pida.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Refund NOS on Rewind\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Devolver NOS ao retroceder\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RefundOnRewind.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rewinding gives back the NOS you used since the point you rewind to.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ao retroceder, voc\303\252 recebe de volta o NOS usado desde o ponto para onde voltou.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Controller Rumble\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vibra\303\247\303\243o do controle no NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Rumble.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Rumbles the controller while NOS is active. The game's own rumble isn't affected.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Faz o controle vibrar enquanto o NOS est\303\241 ativo. A vibra\303\247\303\243o do pr\303\263prio jogo n\303\243o \303\251 afetada.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS dos Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarNitro.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatars use NOS too, whenever they can (not before the race starts), from a tank with twice your capacity and recharge, with flames and sound. Not once they're over 100 m ahead of you, so you can catch up. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Os Drivatars tamb\303\251m usam NOS sempre que podem (nunca antes da largada), com um tanque de capacidade e recarga duas vezes maiores que as suas, com chamas e som. N\303\243o quando est\303\243o mais de 100 m \303\240 sua frente, para voc\303\252 poder alcan\303\247\303\241-los. Vale na hora.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Require NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Exigir kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RequireNitrousKit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: only cars with the NOS Kit (Garage > Upgrades > Custom upgrade > Engine) have NOS, and the stage sets the tank and its recharge. Off: every car has NOS, with the NOS Tank Capacity and NOS Recharge Rate, and the NOS Kit isn't in the garage.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ligado: s\303\263 carros com o kit de NOS (comprado na garagem, como melhoria do motor) t\303\252m NOS, e o est\303\241gio define o tanque e a recarga. Desligado: todos os carros t\303\252m NOS, com a capacidade do tanque de NOS e a recarga do NOS, e o kit de NOS n\303\243o aparece na garagem.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Hide NOS Gauge Without Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ocultar medidor sem kit\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudHide.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"On: the NOS gauge frame is hidden on cars without a NOS Kit. Off: an empty frame stays.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Ligado: a moldura do medidor de NOS fica oculta nos carros sem kit de NOS. Desligado: fica uma moldura vazia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Blue Vignette\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Vinheta azul do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.VignetteEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"A pulsing blue vignette at the screen edges while NOS is active.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Uma vinheta azul pulsante nas bordas da tela enquanto o NOS est\303\241 ativo.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Speed Lines\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Linhas de velocidade do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SpeedLinesEnabled.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Thin blue streaks flying out toward the screen edges while NOS is active, in step with the car's speed.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Finos riscos azuis voando para as bordas da tela enquanto o NOS est\303\241 ativo, no ritmo da velocidade do carro.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Button\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Bot\303\243o do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Which button burns NOS. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"O bot\303\243o que usa o NOS. Escolha um que o jogo n\303\243o use ao dirigir. Vale na hora.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroButton.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Pick one the game doesn't use while driving. Applies right away.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 LB, 2 RB, 3 A, 4 B, 5 X, 6 Y, 7 LS click, 8 RS click, 9 D-Pad Up, 10 D-Pad Down, 11 D-Pad Left, 12 D-Pad Right, 13 Back, 14 Start, 15 LT, 16 RT. Escolha um que o jogo n\303\243o use ao dirigir. Vale na hora.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"HUD Theme\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tema da tela do jogo\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.choice.0\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Original: the game's HUD with a yellow NOS bar. Fast & Furious: cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original: a tela do jogo com barra de NOS amarela. Fast & Furious: barra de NOS, marchas e \303\255cones de assist\303\252ncia em ciano.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.HudTheme.slider_description\"\n"
     "msgid \"1 Original (yellow NOS bar), 2 Fast & Furious (cyan NOS bar, gears and assist icons).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"1 Original (barra de NOS amarela), 2 Fast & Furious (barra de NOS, marchas e \303\255cones de assist\303\252ncia em ciano).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Boost Multiplier\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplicador do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.TorqueScale.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Multiplies forward acceleration while NOS is active (Spire default: 1.6x).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Multiplica a acelera\303\247\303\243o para a frente enquanto o NOS est\303\241 ativo (padr\303\243o do Spire: 1,6x).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Tank Capacity (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Capacidade do tanque de NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.Duration.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Total seconds of continuous boost available in a full tank (Spire default: 20s). Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the tank.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS cont\303\255nuo em um tanque cheio (padr\303\243o do Spire: 20 s). Ignorado com Exigir kit de NOS ligado: a\303\255 o est\303\241gio do kit de NOS define o tanque.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Buildup Time (sec)\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tempo de entrada do NOS (s)\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.BuildupTime.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Time taken to ramp up to full boost torque (Spire default: 0.5s).\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tempo at\303\251 chegar \303\240 for\303\247a total do NOS (padr\303\243o do Spire: 0,5 s).\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Recharge Rate\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Recarga do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.RechargeRate.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Seconds of NOS restored per second while not boosting. Ignored while Require NOS Kit is on: then the NOS Kit's stage sets the recharge rate.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Segundos de NOS recuperados por segundo sem usar o NOS. Ignorado com Exigir kit de NOS ligado: a\303\255 o est\303\241gio do kit de NOS define a recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Sound Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume do som do NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.SoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the boost and stop sounds. The game's own volume sliders don't change them.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume dos sons do NOS. Os controles de volume do pr\303\263prio jogo n\303\243o os alteram.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"Drivatar NOS Volume\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume do NOS dos Drivatars\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.DrivatarSoundVolume.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Volume of the Drivatars' NOS, heard from their cars (with Drivatar NOS on). 0 silences it.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Volume do NOS dos Drivatars, ouvido dos carros deles (com o NOS dos Drivatars ligado). 0 silencia.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Camera Shake\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Tremor da c\303\242mera no NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.CameraShake.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much the camera shakes while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Quanto a c\303\242mera treme com o NOS ativo, nas vis\303\265es do piloto, cap\303\264, para-choque e persegui\303\247\303\243o. 0 desliga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.label\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Wider FOV\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Campo de vis\303\243o maior no NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.FovBoost.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"How much wider the field of view gets while NOS is active, in the driver, hood, bumper and chase views. 0 turns it off.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Quanto o campo de vis\303\243o aumenta com o NOS ativo, nas vis\303\265es do piloto, cap\303\264, para-choque e persegui\303\247\303\243o. 0 desliga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS Kit\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Kit de NOS\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.kit.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS injection. Hold the NOS button while driving; a higher stage has a bigger tank that recharges faster.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Inje\303\247\303\243o de NOS. Segure o bot\303\243o do NOS enquanto dirige; quanto maior o est\303\241gio, maior o tanque e mais r\303\241pida a recarga.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stock\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Original\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage1.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 1 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS est\303\241gio 1\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage2.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 2 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS est\303\241gio 2\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage3.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 3 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS est\303\241gio 3\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage4.name\"\n"
     "msgid \"Stage 4 NOS\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS est\303\241gio 4\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stock.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"No NOS fitted.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"Sem sistema de NOS instalado.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"garage.stage.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"NOS, stage {n}: {s} s tank, recharges {r} s per second.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS, est\303\241gio {n}: tanque de {s} s, recarrega {r} s por segundo.\"\n"
     "\n",
     10215},
