     "msgctxt \"mod.description\"\n"
     "msgid \"Fast & Furious NOS for every car in Forza Horizon 2, with exhaust flames, sound and a NOS gauge. Hold the NOS Button (LB unless you change it) to boost.\"\n"
     "msgstr \"NOS \320\262 \321\201\321\202\320\270\320\273\320\265 Fast & Furious \320\264\320\273\321\217 \320\262\321\201\320\265\321\205 \320\274\320\260\321\210\320\270\320\275 Forza Horizon 2 \342\200\224 \321\201 \320\277\320\273\320\260\320\274\320\265\320\275\320\265\320\274 \320\270\320\267 \320\262\321\213\321\205\320\273\320\276\320\277\320\260, \320\267\320\262\321\203\320\272\320\276\320\274 \320\270 \321\210\320\272\320\260\320\273\320\276\320\271 NOS. \320\243\320\264\320\265\321\200\320\266\320\270\320\262\320\260\320\271\321\202\320\265 \320\272\320\275\320\276\320\277\320\272\321\203 NOS (\320\277\320\276 \321\203\320\274\320\276\320\273\321\207\320\260\320\275\320\270\321\216 LB) \320\264\320\273\321\217 \321\203\321\201\320\272\320\276\321\200\320\265\320\275\320\270\321\217.\"\n"
     "\n"
     "msgctxt \"row.NitroEnabled.label\"\n"
